by the same actor.


00:40:34.217 --> 00:40:36.654
But I need real proof!Ivo!


00:40:36.828 --> 00:40:38.134
We have very little time.


00:40:39.657 --> 00:40:41.790
But I could field
a couple of queries.


00:40:41.964 --> 00:40:45.097
Name the most elegant formula
in mathematics.


00:40:45.271 --> 00:40:46.621
Euler'’s Identity.


00:40:46.795 --> 00:40:49.101
E to the I times pi plus one
equals zilch.


00:40:49.275 --> 00:40:51.103
European capitals
arranged alphabetically


00:40:51.277 --> 00:40:52.540
by the fourth letter.


00:40:52.714 --> 00:40:54.455
Riga, Monaco, Sarajevo, Tirana.


00:40:54.629 --> 00:40:56.413
The speed of light
divided by the speed of sound,


00:40:56.587 --> 00:40:58.633
divided by
the speed of the bus in the movie <i>Speed.</i>


00:40:58.807 --> 00:41:00.156
[mimics adding machine]


00:41:00.330 --> 00:41:02.898
17,893.33333...


00:41:03.072 --> 00:41:06.510
Rounding up?17,894 MPH.


00:41:06.684 --> 00:41:09.165
And, for all the marbles...


00:41:09.339 --> 00:41:11.515
Good. I lost mine.


00:41:11.689 --> 00:41:13.735
A rare lung disease,


00:41:13.909 --> 00:41:16.999
and the longest word
in the English dictionary.


00:41:17.652 --> 00:41:19.131
Um...


00:41:19.305 --> 00:41:22.613
[both] Pneumonoultramicroscopic-
silicovolcanoconiosis!


00:41:23.484 --> 00:41:27.139
Pap-pap!In the saggy flesh.


00:41:27.313 --> 00:41:29.402
But looking pretty good
for a hundred and ten.


00:41:29.577 --> 00:41:31.143
[shuddering grunt]


00:41:31.840 --> 00:41:34.451
Oh, Grampy-poo! [laughs]


00:41:37.846 --> 00:41:41.632
Where have you been
my entire life?


00:41:41.806 --> 00:41:43.373
[moans happily]


00:41:43.547 --> 00:41:45.549
