to everything.


00:42:18.408 --> 00:42:20.062
Come on, kiddo.


00:42:28.461 --> 00:42:30.855
[groaning]


00:42:33.858 --> 00:42:35.817
Oh, no. Oh, no, no.


00:42:35.991 --> 00:42:37.819
Someone tell me
this is some kind of


00:42:37.993 --> 00:42:40.125
