You sicken me.


00:42:55.837 --> 00:42:58.230
You must be
the long-lost grandson.


00:42:58.404 --> 00:43:01.277
And you must be
another stinking hedgehog.


00:43:01.451 --> 00:43:03.496
So you'’re the one
behind all this.


00:43:03.671 --> 00:43:05.890
The Shadow breakout.The attack on Walters.


00:43:06.064 --> 00:43:07.239
That musty
old-man smell.


00:43:07.413 --> 00:43:09.372
How dare you insult me


00:43:09.546 --> 00:43:11.200
