exposition!


00:43:11.374 --> 00:43:13.463
Shadow, get the key.


00:43:13.637 --> 00:43:14.638
Where is it?


00:43:14.812 --> 00:43:16.901
Ha! Good one, Hot Topic.


00:43:17.075 --> 00:43:19.164
Do you really think
we'’d be that stupid


00:43:19.338 --> 00:43:21.384
