to take everything from them.


00:43:28.609 --> 00:43:29.871
[Gerald] With this.


00:43:30.045 --> 00:43:33.701
My masterpiece
of malevolence...


00:43:33.875 --> 00:43:36.399
The Eclipse Cannon.


00:43:36.573 --> 00:43:39.663
<i>In exchange</i>
<i>for my freedom,</i>


00:43:39.837 --> 00:43:41.970
<i>I gave GUN</i>
<i>the most powerful weapon</i>


00:43:42.144 --> 00:43:44.668
<i>mankind has ever seen,</i>


00:43:44.842 --> 00:43:47.410
<i>capable of delivering</i>
<i>a precision strike</i>


00:43:47.584 --> 00:43:48.977
<i>anywhere on Earth.</i>


00:43:50.413 --> 00:43:51.632
<i>Our first target:</i>


00:43:52.458 --> 00:43:54.112
<i>GUN Headquarters.</i>


00:43:54.286 --> 00:43:56.419
But firing a weapon
that powerful


00:43:56.593 --> 00:43:58.551
could threaten millions
of innocent lives!


00:43:58.726 --> 00:44:00.989
Yeah, tera-bite me.[cackles]


00:44:01.163 --> 00:44:06.037
This is one of two keys required
to launch the Eclipse Cannon.


00:44:06.211 --> 00:44:08.518
The other is locked
inside GUN headquarters.


00:44:08.692 --> 00:44:10.563
Once we have both,


00:44:10.738 --> 00:44:13.566
I will take rightful control
of my weapon.


00:44:13.741 --> 00:44:15.525
I'’m in.


00:44:22.488 --> 00:44:23.968
Holy crab!


00:44:24.142 --> 00:44:25.753
[Robotnik]
Spacious and crustaceous.


00:44:26.667 --> 00:44:27.842
Thank you so much


00:44:28.016 --> 00:44:29.670
