this little adventure.


00:44:29.844 --> 00:44:32.020
It really worked out
for me.


00:44:32.194 --> 00:44:35.153
And you wonder why
I have trust issues!


00:44:36.633 --> 00:44:38.809
Shadow, wait! Don'’t do this.


00:44:38.983 --> 00:44:40.376
I know you'’re hurting,


00:44:40.550 --> 00:44:43.074
