one of my rings!


00:45:29.947 --> 00:45:31.166
[Sonic] Got one.


00:45:31.340 --> 00:45:33.559
Check this out. Trick shot!


00:45:33.734 --> 00:45:34.952
[grunts]


00:45:37.259 --> 00:45:38.739
Come on.


00:45:40.001 --> 00:45:41.567
Come on.


00:45:41.742 --> 00:45:43.395
Come on.[Knuckles groans]


00:45:45.006 --> 00:45:46.703
[both] Come on!


00:45:47.443 --> 00:45:48.357
[yells]


00:45:48.531 --> 00:45:50.707
[all yelling]


00:45:56.104 --> 00:45:58.628
Yeah! Yes!


00:46:02.327 --> 00:46:03.328
[Sonic] Yikes.


00:46:04.634 --> 00:46:06.418
Somebody better call
Google Maps.


00:46:07.593 --> 00:46:10.161
[rumbling faintly]


00:46:10.335 --> 00:46:14.470
I'’ve spent years
trying to cleanse the cosmos


00:46:14.644 --> 00:46:18.300
