00:46:23.653 --> 00:46:27.570
There'’s nothing
we can'’t destroy together, my boy.


00:46:27.744 --> 00:46:30.616
Charting route to GUN
Headquarters in London, sirs.


00:46:30.791 --> 00:46:32.880
ETA four hours.


00:46:33.054 --> 00:46:34.359
As the crab flies.


00:46:34.533 --> 00:46:36.884
By all accounts,
we'’re ahead of schedule.


00:46:37.841 --> 00:46:39.756
We should take this time


00:46:39.930 --> 00:46:41.932
