each other better.


00:46:42.106 --> 00:46:43.847
Wow. What?


00:46:44.587 --> 00:46:45.675
You mean...


00:46:45.849 --> 00:46:49.113
spend some
qua-qua-quality time?


00:46:49.287 --> 00:46:54.031
You'’ve waited for this
