to spend one perfect day with your new grand pal?


00:47:12.354 --> 00:47:13.659
[elbow thuds][grunts]


00:47:14.573 --> 00:47:16.097
[both screaming]


00:47:16.271 --> 00:47:18.099
["Wouldn'’t It Be Nice"
by the Beach Boys playing]


00:47:18.839 --> 00:47:20.144
