00:47:54.396 --> 00:47:57.703
Ooh! [chortling]


00:47:57.878 --> 00:48:00.619
[rockets whistle and explode]


00:48:11.935 --> 00:48:13.719
[song fades out]


00:48:15.417 --> 00:48:18.420
[song resumes]


00:48:25.514 --> 00:48:26.994
[song ends]


00:48:36.525 --> 00:48:37.961
And done!


00:48:38.135 --> 00:48:40.877
Masterpiece.
Look at that.Yay!


00:48:41.051 --> 00:48:44.489
It'’s really been great
having time to ourselves.


00:48:44.663 --> 00:48:47.101
Right. Absolutely.
I just feel so...


00:48:47.275 --> 00:48:48.667
