Clearheaded.


00:48:48.841 --> 00:48:51.148
Mmm, look at all these
new interests we found.


00:48:51.322 --> 00:48:53.324
I know, so many hobbies.So many!


00:48:53.498 --> 00:48:56.327
After the action and adventure
of the last few years,


00:48:56.501 --> 00:48:58.721
well, I could get used to this.Same.


00:48:58.895 --> 00:49:00.897
[deep rumbling]


00:49:04.466 --> 00:49:06.816
[Sonic] Tom! Maddie!
We need your help on a super--


00:49:06.990 --> 00:49:09.819
Knuckles, do you mind?Oh! Excuse me.


00:49:09.993 --> 00:49:11.429
Tom! Maddie! We need your help


00:49:11.603 --> 00:49:13.127
on a super-dangerous
top-secret mission!


00:49:13.301 --> 00:49:14.345
Hmm.


00:49:16.086 --> 00:49:17.740
Thank God. Yeah, we'’re in.Let'’s go.


00:49:17.914 --> 00:49:20.134
Really? You'’re in?
Just like that?


00:49:20.308 --> 00:49:23.050
Yes. It was getting so boring
without you guys here.Yeah. So...


00:49:23.224 --> 00:49:24.877
No offense....boring. No, none taken.


00:49:25.052 --> 00:49:26.531
I mean, whatever crazy plan
you'’re cooking up,


00:49:26.705 --> 00:49:28.011
the answer'’s yes.Yes.


00:49:28.185 --> 00:49:31.145
Great. But first things first:
What is that?


00:49:31.319 --> 00:49:32.798
Oh! This is...


00:49:32.973 --> 00:49:34.409
[in puppet voice]
...Li'’l Tom!


00:49:34.583 --> 00:49:36.063
[normal voice]
Isn'’t he great?


00:49:37.629 --> 00:49:39.849
I told you
to get rid of that. It'’s very creepy.


00:49:40.023 --> 00:49:41.198
[puppet voice]
I told him to get rid of you.


00:49:41.372 --> 00:49:42.765
