Whoa!


01:02:57.689 --> 01:02:59.691
My feet. Why can'’t I
use my beautiful feet?


01:02:59.866 --> 01:03:01.345
Heh-heh![Rockwell] Because...


01:03:01.519 --> 01:03:04.566
this vault is armed
with variable gravity.


01:03:04.740 --> 01:03:05.959
[straining]


01:03:06.133 --> 01:03:06.960
No kidding.


01:03:07.134 --> 01:03:08.918
[Rockwell] Green goes up...


01:03:09.092 --> 01:03:11.268
and red takes you down... hard.


01:03:11.442 --> 01:03:12.617
Rockwell, listen to me.


01:03:12.792 --> 01:03:14.576
The Robotniks are planning to--
[yelps]


01:03:14.750 --> 01:03:16.665
Oh, they'’re planning on stealing
a second key, just like you are?


01:03:16.839 --> 01:03:18.232
Yes, I'’m aware.


01:03:19.755 --> 01:03:22.279
I called it
the second Commander Walters was attacked.


01:03:22.453 --> 01:03:23.933
So...


01:03:24.107 --> 01:03:26.675
thank you
for taking the bait


01:03:26.849 --> 01:03:28.329
and falling
right into my trap.


01:03:28.503 --> 01:03:30.635
I don'’t believe this.


01:03:30.810 --> 01:03:32.420
[Gerald]
I know, grandson.


01:03:32.594 --> 01:03:34.596
A woman in the military!


01:03:36.511 --> 01:03:37.947
Let'’s go.


01:03:39.035 --> 01:03:40.254
Go, positions!


01:03:40.428 --> 01:03:41.516
Full perimeter.


01:03:41.690 --> 01:03:42.909
[weapons powering up]


01:03:43.083 --> 01:03:44.388
Robotnik.


01:03:44.562 --> 01:03:46.826
Going full spandex, huh?
Who'’s the fossil?


01:03:47.000 --> 01:03:51.134
That'’s my grandfather,
you dough-eating dimbecile.


01:03:51.308 --> 01:03:54.398
Who are they?A couple of bleeding hearts,


01:03:54.572 --> 01:03:57.401
here to rescue
their emotional-support animals.


01:03:57.575 --> 01:03:59.360
Enough! It'’s over.


01:03:59.534 --> 01:04:03.103
The only way
you'’re leaving here is in handcuffs.


01:04:03.277 --> 01:04:04.974
There is no other way out.


01:04:05.148 --> 01:04:07.934
You know, there might be
one other way out.


01:04:08.108 --> 01:04:09.500
And what is that
supposed to mean?


01:04:09.674 --> 01:04:11.589
[Sonic] Hey, big guy,
I think it'’s time to...


01:04:12.764 --> 01:04:16.072
Break glass
in case of emergency!


01:04:18.031 --> 01:04:20.076
[roaring]


01:04:20.947 --> 01:04:22.209
[grunts]


01:04:23.210 --> 01:04:26.256
Ha! Nothing can stop
Team Knuckles!


01:04:26.430 --> 01:04:27.518
Open fire!


01:04:28.519 --> 01:04:30.391
[yelps] Knuckles,
turn this stuff off!


01:04:30.565 --> 01:04:31.871
Hurry!On it.


01:04:33.481 --> 01:04:34.569
Uh-oh.


01:04:34.743 --> 01:04:36.701
[all yelling in surprise]


01:04:36.876 --> 01:04:38.878
[grunting]


01:04:42.185 --> 01:04:44.535
Ha! See how you like it--
[groans]


01:04:44.709 --> 01:04:46.711
[yelping]


01:04:48.278 --> 01:04:50.063
[both gasp]


01:04:50.237 --> 01:04:51.891
[all groaning]


01:04:52.065 --> 01:04:54.110
Can you move?No, not at all.


01:04:54.284 --> 01:04:56.721
Tails, can you?No, I'’m stuck.


01:04:56.896 --> 01:04:58.288
We might be here a while.


01:04:58.462 --> 01:05:00.464
[growls, grunts]


01:05:00.638 --> 01:05:02.902
Whoa! Whoa. Whoa. Whoa.


01:05:03.903 --> 01:05:05.339
Where'’s the key?


01:05:11.258 --> 01:05:12.476
Whoa!


01:05:12.650 --> 01:05:15.305
What was that?We might have a problem.


01:05:16.959 --> 01:05:18.918
[grunts] No, no, no, no!


01:05:20.093 --> 01:05:22.573
[grunting]


01:05:26.577 --> 01:05:28.188
[exclaims]


01:05:29.102 --> 01:05:30.190
[huffs]


01:05:39.634 --> 01:05:41.723
I'’m moving.


01:05:42.506 --> 01:05:44.117
I'’m moving!


01:05:47.294 --> 01:05:49.731
You go get it, grandson!


01:05:50.471 --> 01:05:51.515
Hey!


01:05:51.689 --> 01:05:53.517
Oh, whoa, whoa...


01:05:56.042 --> 01:05:57.913
No. No, no!


01:05:58.522 --> 01:06:00.220
I'’m almost there!


01:06:03.049 --> 01:06:03.832
Whoa!


01:06:04.006 --> 01:06:05.399
[groaning]


01:06:09.011 --> 01:06:10.578
Sonic!


01:06:17.019 --> 01:06:19.717
[gasps][all yelling, grunting]


01:06:19.891 --> 01:06:20.762
[heavy grunt]


01:06:22.155 --> 01:06:23.460
[yells]


01:06:23.634 --> 01:06:25.985
That was so not worth it!


01:06:26.986 --> 01:06:28.117
Ooh!


01:06:31.251 --> 01:06:32.992
You okay?Yeah. You good?


01:06:33.166 --> 01:06:33.905
Sonic!


01:06:34.080 --> 01:06:35.907
[Tom] Hey.[groaning]


01:06:36.082 --> 01:06:39.302
Sonic, one,
concrete boulder, zero.


01:06:39.476 --> 01:06:40.434
[sighing]


01:06:40.608 --> 01:06:41.913
Thanks for the save.


01:06:42.088 --> 01:06:43.611
Cutting it a little close,
don'’t you think?


01:06:45.047 --> 01:06:46.396
Secure the room!


01:06:48.398 --> 01:06:49.617
She'’s got the key.


01:06:52.359 --> 01:06:53.447
I got an idea.


01:07:02.673 --> 01:07:04.110
Commander Walters.


01:07:04.284 --> 01:07:05.372
Sir.


01:07:05.546 --> 01:07:07.156
You'’re...Still alive?


01:07:07.330 --> 01:07:10.116
I'’ll die before I let that key
fall into the wrong hands.


01:07:10.986 --> 01:07:12.379
Thanks for keeping it safe.


01:07:12.553 --> 01:07:14.033
I'’ll take it from here.


01:07:16.731 --> 01:07:18.559
That'’s an order,
Director Rockwell.


01:07:22.258 --> 01:07:24.913
Now, organize
the reinforcements.


01:07:26.262 --> 01:07:27.350
Yes, sir.


01:07:33.095 --> 01:07:35.315
Guys, guys, I got the key.
I repeat, I got the key.


01:07:35.489 --> 01:07:37.099
Now let'’s get out of here.


01:07:41.321 --> 01:07:43.584
Commander Walters.


01:07:43.758 --> 01:07:45.455
No, no. No. Wait!


01:07:59.730 --> 01:08:01.167
What?


01:08:01.341 --> 01:08:03.865
Tom! Everyone'’s clear!
Come on, let'’s go!


01:08:04.039 --> 01:08:05.910
You. What are you--


01:08:07.608 --> 01:08:08.652
Tom!


01:08:09.784 --> 01:08:11.829
Tom. Tom, what happened?


01:08:12.003 --> 01:08:13.527
Speak to me. Come on.


01:08:13.701 --> 01:08:15.877
Come on,
it'’s gonna be okay.


01:08:16.051 --> 01:08:19.098
Please, please, please get up.
Hey, come on, please wake up.


01:08:19.272 --> 01:08:20.882
Wake up, wake up, come on.


01:08:21.578 --> 01:08:22.971
Wake up, wake up, wake up!


01:08:23.667 --> 01:08:25.104
Maria.


01:08:29.151 --> 01:08:30.848
What did you do?


01:08:33.068 --> 01:08:35.114
What I had to.


01:08:37.768 --> 01:08:39.466
Oh, my God. Tom!


01:08:42.686 --> 01:08:44.384
Help me up, kid.


01:08:44.558 --> 01:08:46.125
[grunting]


01:08:47.213 --> 01:08:48.518
Freeze! Don'’t move!


01:08:48.692 --> 01:08:53.567
Any tricks up your sleeve,
Captain Grandtastic?


01:08:53.741 --> 01:08:55.177
[soldiers grunting]


01:08:57.397 --> 01:08:58.615
[terrified yelp]


01:09:00.313 --> 01:09:02.358
We got what we came for.


01:09:03.098 --> 01:09:05.970
Great job, Shadow.


01:09:06.710 --> 01:09:09.583
We have both keys.


01:09:09.757 --> 01:09:12.542
So where'’s your little
science project?


01:09:13.935 --> 01:09:17.895
It'’s closer than you think,
my boy.


01:09:20.071 --> 01:09:21.595
Welcome...[yelps]


01:09:21.769 --> 01:09:25.120
...to my masterpiece!


01:09:28.036 --> 01:09:29.777
I must hand it to GUN.


01:09:29.951 --> 01:09:33.389
They built her
to my exact specifications.


01:09:33.563 --> 01:09:34.738
It'’s...


01:09:36.392 --> 01:09:37.959
remarkable!


01:09:38.133 --> 01:09:39.352
Mm-hmm.


01:09:39.526 --> 01:09:42.355
Astounding!Yes.


01:09:43.486 --> 01:09:45.619
That'’s my genius grand-genome!


01:09:45.793 --> 01:09:49.405
And I have one more surprise.


01:09:51.886 --> 01:09:55.890
It'’s a new suit!


01:09:59.633 --> 01:10:01.548
[giddy squealing]


01:10:03.114 --> 01:10:05.291
[excited grunting]


01:10:05.465 --> 01:10:06.292
Gee.


01:10:06.466 --> 01:10:08.076
[smooching]


01:10:08.772 --> 01:10:10.818
[grunting]


01:10:25.833 --> 01:10:28.227
♪ <i>I'’m a chip</i>
<i>Off the old block</i>♪


01:10:28.401 --> 01:10:30.490
♪ <i>I'’m a chip</i>
<i>Off the old block</i>♪


01:10:30.664 --> 01:10:33.449
♪ <i>I'’m a chip off</i>
<i>The old block!</i>♪


01:10:33.623 --> 01:10:34.929
[ring tone chiming]


01:10:35.103 --> 01:10:37.018
What do you want, Stone?
I'’m busy.


01:10:37.192 --> 01:10:40.195
Doctor, I have a bad feeling
about this.


01:10:40.369 --> 01:10:43.329
I don'’t think your grandfather'’s
been completely honest with us.


01:10:43.503 --> 01:10:45.200
It was something Shadow said.


01:10:45.983 --> 01:10:47.202
<i>There'’s more to their plan.</i>


01:10:48.638 --> 01:10:51.685
How dare you!


01:10:51.859 --> 01:10:54.644
You have been jealous
of my long-lost grand-Pop-Tart


01:10:54.818 --> 01:10:56.951
since the very beginning!


01:10:57.125 --> 01:10:59.780
I no longer require
your obsequious groveling.


01:10:59.954 --> 01:11:02.435
<i>Consider this your notice</i>
<i>of termination.</i>


01:11:02.609 --> 01:11:06.003
Your letter of reference
will be L for Loser.


01:11:06.177 --> 01:11:08.005
Of course,
I'’ll expect you to stay on


01:11:08.179 --> 01:11:09.659
until you'’ve been
successfully cloned.


01:11:09.833 --> 01:11:13.315
But you and I are done!


01:11:13.489 --> 01:11:15.926
Like a blackened
catfish dinner!


01:11:16.100 --> 01:11:19.365
Sir, it'’s too dangerous and
I'’m not there to protect you.


01:11:19.539 --> 01:11:20.670
I already lost you once! I--


01:11:20.844 --> 01:11:22.977
Unsubscribe.
Blocked and reported.


01:11:24.195 --> 01:11:26.110
[breath shaking]
I can'’t lose you again.


01:11:28.025 --> 01:11:29.636
[sighs]


01:11:32.552 --> 01:11:34.118
Do the honors...


01:11:34.858 --> 01:11:36.033
grandson.


01:11:37.948 --> 01:11:39.254
Here we go.


01:12:05.585 --> 01:12:07.761
[excited chatter]


01:12:42.448 --> 01:12:45.494
[sirens wailing][indistinct radio chatter]


01:13:05.340 --> 01:13:07.516
[siren wails]


01:13:13.522 --> 01:13:15.263
It'’ll be okay, Sonic.


01:13:15.437 --> 01:13:17.091
It'’ll be okay?


01:13:17.265 --> 01:13:19.789
Tom is fighting for his life
and you think it'’ll be okay?


01:13:19.963 --> 01:13:23.184
The fox is simply trying
to comfort you.


01:13:23.358 --> 01:13:25.229
Comfort'’s not
what I need right now.


01:13:25.404 --> 01:13:28.537
I need to stop them.
By any means necessary.


01:13:28.711 --> 01:13:29.886
Wait, you don'’t mean--


01:13:30.060 --> 01:13:32.149
The Master Emerald.


01:13:32.323 --> 01:13:35.501
The Emerald must never be
wielded for vengeance.


01:13:35.675 --> 01:13:36.719
Not ever!


01:13:36.893 --> 01:13:38.547
We swore a sacred oath.


01:13:38.721 --> 01:13:40.680
Don'’t talk to me about oaths.
Not now!


01:13:40.854 --> 01:13:42.725
But you told Tom
using the Emerald


01:13:42.899 --> 01:13:44.335
wasn'’t the right choice.


01:13:44.510 --> 01:13:46.599
Well, now it'’s the only choice.


01:13:46.773 --> 01:13:48.557
And if neither of you
have the guts to help me,


01:13:48.731 --> 01:13:50.167
then I'’ll do it alone.


01:13:50.341 --> 01:13:52.431
But I thought
the three of us were a team.


01:13:52.605 --> 01:13:54.607
I thought that'’s what
made us special.


01:13:54.781 --> 01:13:56.565
I'’m not asking you twice,
Knuckles.


01:13:57.436 --> 01:14:00.264
Where is the Master Emerald?


01:14:02.005 --> 01:14:05.356
Your heart is being consumed
by anger, hedgehog.


01:14:05.531 --> 01:14:08.577
You are in no condition
to make decisions right now.


01:14:08.751 --> 01:14:11.319
I know you'’re upset about Tom.
We all are.


01:14:11.493 --> 01:14:13.190
Last chance.


01:14:13.364 --> 01:14:15.976
Where... is it?


01:14:16.542 --> 01:14:18.065
Don'’t do this.


01:14:24.724 --> 01:14:27.683
Part of our oath
is to trust each other.


01:14:27.857 --> 01:14:30.077
And I must abide
by that promise,


01:14:30.251 --> 01:14:32.558
even if you have chosen
to break it.


01:14:32.732 --> 01:14:34.473
But heed this warning:


01:14:34.647 --> 01:14:37.998
The Master Emerald is guarded
by a fearsome warrior.


01:14:38.172 --> 01:14:40.348
And to seize
this ultimate power,


01:14:40.522 --> 01:14:42.437
you will have to go...


01:14:42.611 --> 01:14:44.657
through him.


01:14:44.831 --> 01:14:45.962
[exhales deeply]


01:14:46.136 --> 01:14:48.748
Okay, Wade...
all comes down to this.


01:14:49.488 --> 01:14:51.141
Last few seconds.


01:14:51.315 --> 01:14:52.447
Whipple down the ice.


01:14:52.621 --> 01:14:56.146
He shoots... he scores!


01:14:56.320 --> 01:14:59.367
Wade Whipple
is a champion again!


01:14:59.541 --> 01:15:00.716
[cackles]


01:15:05.286 --> 01:15:08.463
Oh, hey, Sonic. See my goal?
Pretty sick, right?


01:15:08.637 --> 01:15:10.465
I'’m here for the Emerald.


01:15:10.639 --> 01:15:12.162
Look, Sonic, I'’m sorry.


01:15:12.336 --> 01:15:14.513
I promised to guard this emerald
with my life.


01:15:14.687 --> 01:15:16.515
I will do whatever it takes--


01:15:17.646 --> 01:15:18.734
Well, I tried.


01:15:20.649 --> 01:15:22.869
[thunder rumbling]


01:15:24.174 --> 01:15:25.175
[Wade] Sonic!


01:15:29.092 --> 01:15:30.093
Too bright!


01:15:33.706 --> 01:15:36.752
[woman] <i>This is an urgent </i>
<i>national emergency broadcast.</i>


01:15:36.926 --> 01:15:39.363
<i>A spacecraft designed</i>
<i>by the agency GUN</i>


01:15:39.538 --> 01:15:42.453
<i>has been hijacked and launched </i>
<i>out of the River Thames.</i>


01:15:42.628 --> 01:15:46.240
[man broadcasting in Japanese]


01:15:48.242 --> 01:15:51.288
[man] <i>All residents are urged </i>
<i>to seek immediate shelter.</i>


01:16:13.354 --> 01:16:15.617
[Gerald] It'’s time, Shadow.


01:16:17.271 --> 01:16:21.362
Professor, is this really
what Maria would have wanted?


01:16:24.147 --> 01:16:27.498
The question isn'’t
what Maria would have wanted.


01:16:28.630 --> 01:16:30.632
It'’s what do they deserve.


01:16:31.633 --> 01:16:34.114
Remember what she meant to us.


01:16:35.985 --> 01:16:38.901
Remember what they took from us.


01:16:49.346 --> 01:16:50.391
[Gerald] Kids!


01:16:50.565 --> 01:16:52.480
We have to go, now!


01:16:52.654 --> 01:16:54.264
[Maria panting]


01:16:57.703 --> 01:17:00.140
[Gerald] They want to take
Shadow away from us, Maria!


01:17:04.971 --> 01:17:06.146
[weapons charging]


01:17:08.757 --> 01:17:11.455
Hey! Hey! What are you doing?
Those are children.


01:17:11.630 --> 01:17:13.414
We'’ve got our orders, Walters!Stand down!


01:17:15.068 --> 01:17:16.939
[gasps]


01:17:24.817 --> 01:17:26.819
[muffled rumbling]


01:17:28.211 --> 01:17:29.430
[high-pitched whistling]


01:17:29.604 --> 01:17:31.345
[groaning]


01:17:37.264 --> 01:17:38.482
Huh?


01:17:40.049 --> 01:17:41.137
Maria!


01:18:14.867 --> 01:18:16.259
[angry roar]


01:18:16.912 --> 01:18:18.697
[panting heavily]


01:18:28.619 --> 01:18:31.622
Excuse me,
Grand Paso Doble.


01:18:31.797 --> 01:18:34.756
What is that thermonuclear
gerbil doing?


01:18:34.930 --> 01:18:37.280
[Gerald] Infusing the core...


01:18:37.454 --> 01:18:38.934
with chaos energy.


01:18:39.108 --> 01:18:41.720
That'’s my little secret.


01:18:41.894 --> 01:18:44.505
The Eclipse Cannon
is about to turn this planet


01:18:44.679 --> 01:18:47.464
into a flaming pile
of rubble,


01:18:47.638 --> 01:18:52.469
wiping out everything
in a 25,000-mile radius.


01:18:55.646 --> 01:18:57.823
Including us.


01:19:01.740 --> 01:19:03.002
What?


01:19:03.916 --> 01:19:07.006
We can'’t annihilate
the Earth!


01:19:07.180 --> 01:19:11.619
Hmm?By combining our genius,
we can rule humanity.


01:19:11.793 --> 01:19:12.707
Together!


01:19:12.881 --> 01:19:15.971
Humanity is a failed experiment.


01:19:16.145 --> 01:19:18.365
If anyone should know that,
it'’s you.


01:19:20.106 --> 01:19:23.022
All your life, you'’ve been
rejected by this world.


01:19:23.892 --> 01:19:25.546
You have nothing down there.


01:19:27.156 --> 01:19:29.202
No one who cares about you.


01:19:30.986 --> 01:19:32.553
But I have you now.


01:19:35.251 --> 01:19:36.644
We'’re family.


01:19:37.558 --> 01:19:39.168
We have each other.


01:19:40.648 --> 01:19:41.910
Oh, Ivo...


01:19:43.738 --> 01:19:45.435
you'’re no Maria.


01:19:48.787 --> 01:19:52.747
The moment I lost her,
my family was gone forever!


01:19:54.401 --> 01:19:56.142
The only way
to give Maria'’s life meaning


01:19:56.316 --> 01:19:58.579
is to destroy the world
that took her from me.


01:19:59.449 --> 01:20:01.582
So I'’m burning it all down!


01:20:04.280 --> 01:20:05.455
It'’s done.


01:20:05.629 --> 01:20:07.936
Good work, Shadow.


01:20:08.110 --> 01:20:09.982
I'’m prepping
the firing sequence.


01:20:10.156 --> 01:20:14.029
The weapon will be fully charged
in ten minutes.


01:20:17.990 --> 01:20:20.079
It'’s almost finished, Maria.


01:20:20.993 --> 01:20:23.343
You will have justice.


01:20:23.517 --> 01:20:25.127
[muffled, distant boom]


01:20:27.738 --> 01:20:29.044
What is that?


01:20:29.958 --> 01:20:32.918
Is GUN launching
missiles at us?


01:20:33.092 --> 01:20:36.138
Impossible.
It'’s moving too fast.


01:20:39.359 --> 01:20:40.882
It'’s him.


01:20:45.234 --> 01:20:46.540
[wind whistling]


01:20:46.714 --> 01:20:48.194
[both grunting]


01:20:49.369 --> 01:20:53.677
You hurt my family.
This ends now!


01:20:53.852 --> 01:20:55.549
Now you know my anger.


01:20:55.723 --> 01:20:58.595
The pain I'’ve felt
for 50 years.


01:20:58.769 --> 01:21:02.034
And you'’ve made
the same choice I did.


01:21:02.208 --> 01:21:03.774
I'’m nothing like you!


01:21:03.949 --> 01:21:05.037
We'’ll see.


01:21:05.211 --> 01:21:07.648
[both yelling]


01:21:12.871 --> 01:21:14.481
Show yourself, coward!


01:21:15.699 --> 01:21:16.875
[grunts]


01:21:18.615 --> 01:21:19.703
[grunts]


01:21:20.530 --> 01:21:21.488
[gasps]


01:21:30.453 --> 01:21:32.673
[screams]


01:21:43.466 --> 01:21:44.728
[shouts]


01:21:44.903 --> 01:21:46.121
[thunder reverberating]


01:21:46.295 --> 01:21:47.949
You were right about one thing.


01:21:48.123 --> 01:21:49.168
[straining]


01:21:49.820 --> 01:21:52.171
This ends now.


01:21:52.867 --> 01:21:55.391
[both grunting]


01:22:18.762 --> 01:22:19.807
What'’s happening?


01:22:19.981 --> 01:22:21.113
Where are they?


01:22:22.157 --> 01:22:23.419
Up there.Where?


01:22:23.593 --> 01:22:24.507
Higher.Hmm?


01:22:24.681 --> 01:22:26.074
[shocked gagging]


01:22:26.248 --> 01:22:27.510
Left yourself open.


01:22:27.684 --> 01:22:29.469
Ivo! What are you doing?


01:22:29.643 --> 01:22:31.036
Thwarting your evil plan!


01:22:37.607 --> 01:22:39.522
[both howling in pain]


01:22:41.960 --> 01:22:43.918
Not the mustache!Agreed.


01:22:44.092 --> 01:22:46.790
Let go on three.
One, two, three!


01:22:47.574 --> 01:22:49.054
[whiskers flapping]


01:22:49.228 --> 01:22:50.403
[beeps]


01:22:51.970 --> 01:22:55.234
[mocking]
Oh... a nano-fist.


01:22:55.408 --> 01:22:59.107
I haven'’t seen that
since I hate-watched <i>Green Lantern</i>in 2011.


01:22:59.281 --> 01:23:01.240
I was saving it for Comic-Con.


01:23:01.414 --> 01:23:03.459
But now there won'’t
be a Comic-Con!


01:23:03.633 --> 01:23:04.678
[yells]


01:23:07.376 --> 01:23:08.987
[both grunting]


01:23:17.125 --> 01:23:19.345
[dust settling]


01:23:26.091 --> 01:23:29.137
Why are you alone?
Where are your friends?


01:23:29.311 --> 01:23:30.834
[straining]


01:23:31.009 --> 01:23:33.402
They tried to stop you,
didn'’t they?


01:23:33.576 --> 01:23:35.056
But you came anyway.


01:23:35.230 --> 01:23:37.667
Your anger was too much.


01:23:37.841 --> 01:23:40.583
What kind of hero
abandons his friends


01:23:40.757 --> 01:23:42.803
to pursue revenge?


01:23:42.977 --> 01:23:45.284
Abandons his family!


01:23:45.458 --> 01:23:48.069
Don'’t you dare talk
about my family.


01:23:48.243 --> 01:23:50.985
And here I thought
you cared for them.


01:23:51.159 --> 01:23:54.293
Especially the one...
What'’s his name?


01:23:54.467 --> 01:23:55.685
Tom?


01:23:55.859 --> 01:23:57.861
[angry howl]


01:24:16.184 --> 01:24:17.881
[Sonic yelling][gasps]


01:24:19.796 --> 01:24:21.885
[strained panting]


01:24:22.060 --> 01:24:24.453
Go ahead. Finish it!


01:24:26.151 --> 01:24:28.501
What are you waiting for? Do it!


01:24:28.675 --> 01:24:31.243
[grunting]I'’m right here!


01:24:32.418 --> 01:24:34.550
You didn'’t let your pain
change who you are...


01:24:35.986 --> 01:24:37.031
in here.


01:24:39.120 --> 01:24:40.904
[whimpering sigh]


01:24:45.474 --> 01:24:47.433
This is not who I am.


01:24:48.129 --> 01:24:49.783
What are you doing?


01:24:49.957 --> 01:24:52.829
You won. Take your revenge.


01:24:54.701 --> 01:24:56.833
There are no winners
with revenge.


01:25:10.151 --> 01:25:11.892
[Maria] <i>Wow.</i>


01:25:12.066 --> 01:25:13.502
[voice echoing]
Look at all those stars.


01:25:14.982 --> 01:25:16.592
<i>They'’re like diamonds.</i>


01:25:18.855 --> 01:25:22.207
The last time I sat
beneath stars like this...


01:25:24.209 --> 01:25:25.775
I was with her.


01:25:27.342 --> 01:25:29.866
I'’ve felt this pain for so long.


01:25:31.564 --> 01:25:33.261
It'’s all I know.


01:25:33.435 --> 01:25:35.655
When I lost Longclaw...


01:25:35.829 --> 01:25:37.526
I felt the same way.


01:25:39.311 --> 01:25:41.748
Did your pain eventually
go away?


01:25:41.922 --> 01:25:43.880
No.


01:25:44.054 --> 01:25:45.969
But in time,
I learned there'’s something


01:25:46.144 --> 01:25:48.450
even more powerful than pain.


01:25:48.624 --> 01:25:50.713
The love we felt for each other.


01:25:51.932 --> 01:25:53.760
That'’s what you need
to hold on to, Shadow.


01:25:53.934 --> 01:25:56.154
Maria might be gone,


01:25:56.328 --> 01:25:58.330
but your love
will always remain.


01:26:12.996 --> 01:26:17.000
"The light shines
even though the star is gone."


01:26:22.092 --> 01:26:24.007
[cannon rumbling in distance]


01:26:28.838 --> 01:26:30.753
This whole mess
is my fault.


01:26:30.927 --> 01:26:33.756
I'’ve been so blinded by rage,
I thought...


01:26:34.453 --> 01:26:36.237
I had no choice.


01:26:39.762 --> 01:26:42.156
You always have a choice.


01:26:47.117 --> 01:26:49.859
But making the right one
is never easy.


01:26:50.033 --> 01:26:51.731
One more thing I learned


01:26:51.905 --> 01:26:54.690
is that when you
really screw something up,


01:26:54.864 --> 01:26:56.344
you can'’t fix it
on your own.


01:26:56.518 --> 01:26:58.738
["Live and Learn"
by Crush 40 playing]


01:27:11.533 --> 01:27:13.187
Gotta go fast.


01:27:13.361 --> 01:27:15.711
Don'’t tell me you'’ve
got a catchphrase.


01:27:15.885 --> 01:27:19.237
That'’s right, new hedgehog.
And everyone loves it.


01:27:34.991 --> 01:27:38.168
I... will... not... try...[grunting]


01:27:38.343 --> 01:27:41.302
...to stop... my...
elders... from...


01:27:41.476 --> 01:27:43.870
destroying... the... world!


01:27:44.697 --> 01:27:45.915
[screams]


01:27:49.528 --> 01:27:51.443
Playtime is over.


01:28:00.147 --> 01:28:02.367
There'’s no going back now.


01:28:02.541 --> 01:28:05.500
[wheezing grunts]


01:28:06.545 --> 01:28:08.895
Set up defense.


01:28:10.853 --> 01:28:12.159
Damn you, autocorrect!


01:28:12.333 --> 01:28:13.595
[attacking grunt]


01:28:16.250 --> 01:28:17.338
[shouts]


01:28:18.034 --> 01:28:19.079
Mantis!


01:28:21.037 --> 01:28:22.300
Oh!


01:28:24.389 --> 01:28:25.520
[cackles]


01:28:25.694 --> 01:28:26.782
Whee!


01:28:27.566 --> 01:28:28.697
[hissing growl]


01:28:28.871 --> 01:28:31.483
I'’m right here,
arach-nerd.


01:28:32.222 --> 01:28:33.049
[shouts]


01:28:33.223 --> 01:28:35.965
[both grunting]


01:28:38.664 --> 01:28:41.797
[cackles]


01:28:41.971 --> 01:28:44.713
That'’s what I call
mantis-scaping.


01:28:44.887 --> 01:28:47.325
That'’s elder abuse!


01:28:50.937 --> 01:28:53.243
[exclaims]


01:28:53.418 --> 01:28:56.638
[female computer voice]
<i>Alert! Alert! Alert!</i>


01:28:56.812 --> 01:28:58.205
Shadow...


01:28:58.379 --> 01:29:00.990
I see you'’ve chosen betrayal.


01:29:02.165 --> 01:29:04.820
And you were once
so useful to me.


01:29:20.532 --> 01:29:22.708
Ready to recycle
some tin cans?


01:29:22.882 --> 01:29:24.492
Just try to keep up.


01:29:55.784 --> 01:29:57.177
[Robotnik]
Please, Grampsy,


01:29:57.351 --> 01:29:59.092
don'’t do this!


01:29:59.266 --> 01:30:01.355
Sorry, kiddo.


01:30:01.529 --> 01:30:04.750
Bring Your Grandkid to Work Day
is over.


01:30:04.924 --> 01:30:05.968
[device beeping]


01:30:06.142 --> 01:30:08.231
[air whistling]


01:30:08.406 --> 01:30:10.756
[yelping]


01:30:10.930 --> 01:30:12.714
Any last words?


01:30:12.888 --> 01:30:15.587
Just one thing...


01:30:16.588 --> 01:30:18.677
that I never thought I'’d say.


01:30:18.851 --> 01:30:20.330
What is it?


01:30:20.505 --> 01:30:22.985
"I love you"?


01:30:23.638 --> 01:30:24.944
No.


01:30:25.118 --> 01:30:27.033
It was something even better.


01:30:27.207 --> 01:30:29.296
But I'’m not gonna say it
if that'’s the way you'’re gonna be.


01:30:29.470 --> 01:30:31.429
Okay. Bye.


01:30:32.430 --> 01:30:34.432
[screaming]


01:30:38.740 --> 01:30:41.047
[cackling]


01:30:41.221 --> 01:30:42.178
[hissing inhale]


01:30:42.352 --> 01:30:43.397
[happy grunt]


01:30:44.311 --> 01:30:46.182
Grandchildren.


01:30:46.356 --> 01:30:49.969
All the fun
and none of the responsibility.


01:30:52.101 --> 01:30:54.887
Who said life was pointless?


01:30:55.670 --> 01:30:58.586
Huh?Oh, right. You did.


01:30:58.760 --> 01:30:59.935
[growls][electricity buzzes]


01:31:00.109 --> 01:31:01.720
[screams]


01:31:02.938 --> 01:31:04.244
[faint zap]


01:31:04.418 --> 01:31:05.941
[Tails, Knuckles cheering][Knuckles] Victory!


01:31:06.115 --> 01:31:08.466
Say what you want
about my granddad,


01:31:08.640 --> 01:31:10.468
he made one
hell of a bug zapper.


01:31:11.294 --> 01:31:12.513
[groans softly]


01:31:12.687 --> 01:31:14.515
We got to stop that laser!


01:31:14.689 --> 01:31:16.909
I knew there was something
I was forgetting.


01:31:27.485 --> 01:31:30.662
We'’re out of time.
The cannon is about to fire!


01:31:30.836 --> 01:31:32.054
Where are you?


01:31:32.228 --> 01:31:34.753
Oh, you know,
just making friends.


01:31:34.927 --> 01:31:36.624
They'’re all yours.


01:31:40.236 --> 01:31:41.890
[laughing]


01:31:45.328 --> 01:31:46.852
[Sonic] Follow me!


01:31:52.945 --> 01:31:55.513
Now, this might hurt a little!


01:31:56.731 --> 01:31:58.951
[all exclaiming]


01:32:09.352 --> 01:32:12.138
So this was your plan?


01:32:12.312 --> 01:32:13.835
[straining] Yeah...


01:32:14.009 --> 01:32:17.491
Would someone mind
shutting down the giant death ray?


01:32:19.928 --> 01:32:21.756
We can'’t stop the cannon
from firing...


01:32:21.930 --> 01:32:24.019
But we can steer it away
from the Earth.


01:32:24.193 --> 01:32:26.544
Coming around to starboard.Aye-aye, Doc.


01:32:30.504 --> 01:32:32.550
Here we go.


01:32:33.768 --> 01:32:35.596
[Tails grunting][Robotnik] It'’s a little tight.


01:32:36.379 --> 01:32:38.599
Definitely not power steering.


01:32:44.518 --> 01:32:47.434
Keep... turning.[straining]


01:32:50.045 --> 01:32:51.873
Jump in anytime here, guys!


01:32:52.047 --> 01:32:53.179
[all straining]


01:32:53.353 --> 01:32:54.833
[steady beeping]


01:32:57.531 --> 01:33:01.361
Can'’t... hold... much... longer.


01:33:01.535 --> 01:33:03.493
[all yelling]


01:33:05.408 --> 01:33:07.236
[exhausted groan]


01:33:10.675 --> 01:33:12.285
[groans]


01:33:18.987 --> 01:33:20.119
Yes![cheering]


01:33:20.293 --> 01:33:22.556
I did it! I did it!


01:33:25.864 --> 01:33:27.561
Oh!Ooh!


01:33:28.214 --> 01:33:29.345
Look what you did!


01:33:29.519 --> 01:33:32.131
Hey, look down there!Sonic!


01:33:38.224 --> 01:33:40.313
Oh, Knuckles,
please tell me you have a--


01:33:40.487 --> 01:33:42.184
Last one.


01:33:42.358 --> 01:33:43.751
Let'’s make it count.


01:33:46.319 --> 01:33:48.364
Ready for a little base of ball?


01:33:49.409 --> 01:33:51.019
Deep breath.


01:33:51.193 --> 01:33:53.892
One... two... three!


01:33:54.936 --> 01:33:57.417
[Knuckles grunting]


01:33:57.591 --> 01:33:58.984
[yells]


01:34:14.260 --> 01:34:15.565
[shocked yell]


01:34:15.740 --> 01:34:17.872
Really!What'’s happening?


01:34:18.046 --> 01:34:20.527
The reactor core is overloading.


01:34:20.701 --> 01:34:23.051
It'’s only a matter of time
before it blows.


01:34:23.225 --> 01:34:24.966
So what does that mean
for Earth?


01:34:25.140 --> 01:34:27.795
A radioactive atmosphere.


01:34:27.969 --> 01:34:30.450
Rain that kills the crops
and melts your flesh.


01:34:30.624 --> 01:34:31.886
Other than that...


01:34:32.060 --> 01:34:33.714
We'’re not done here!


01:34:33.888 --> 01:34:35.803
You try to stabilize
the reactor.


01:34:35.977 --> 01:34:37.196
Buy me some time.


01:34:37.370 --> 01:34:39.415
I'’ll push the station
away from Earth


01:34:39.589 --> 01:34:41.026
before it explodes.


01:34:41.200 --> 01:34:45.204
This is our last chance
to do the right thing.


01:34:46.858 --> 01:34:49.469
[in Spanish]
Go with God


01:34:49.643 --> 01:34:51.863
stinking hedgehog.


01:34:53.125 --> 01:34:55.431
[female computer voice]
<i>Core integrity failing.</i>


01:35:04.614 --> 01:35:06.268
I'’ve got you, Sonic!


01:35:08.270 --> 01:35:09.445
[gasps]


01:35:09.619 --> 01:35:11.230
[moans]


01:35:17.889 --> 01:35:19.325
[straining]


01:35:39.606 --> 01:35:43.001
[computer] <i>Initializing</i>
<i>reactor core stabilizers.</i>


01:36:01.715 --> 01:36:04.413
This is Doctor Ivo Robotnik,


01:36:04.587 --> 01:36:07.329
dedicating my final livestream


01:36:07.503 --> 01:36:10.245
to one very special henchman:


01:36:10.855 --> 01:36:12.247
<i>Agent Stone.</i>


01:36:12.421 --> 01:36:14.641
No, no. Doctor, wait!


01:36:14.815 --> 01:36:17.209
<i>If I can'’t</i>
<i>rule the world...</i>


01:36:18.210 --> 01:36:20.038
I might as well save it...


01:36:20.212 --> 01:36:23.345
for the one and only person
who ever cared about me.


01:36:23.519 --> 01:36:25.434
Don'’t do this, Doctor, please!


01:36:25.608 --> 01:36:29.221
Stone, you were more
than a sycophant to me.


01:36:32.093 --> 01:36:33.355
You were...


01:36:34.835 --> 01:36:36.358
a syco-friend.


01:36:41.929 --> 01:36:45.454
I'’ll miss your lattes
with steamed Austrian goat milk.


01:36:47.413 --> 01:36:49.284
I love the way you make '’em!


01:37:32.371 --> 01:37:36.201
So... I guess there'’s
only one thing left to say.


01:37:36.984 --> 01:37:39.421
[mimics robotic servos]


01:37:40.988 --> 01:37:42.468
It'’s been a real drag.


01:37:43.164 --> 01:37:44.644
Thanks for nothing.


01:37:56.830 --> 01:37:58.440
[birds chirping faintly]


01:38:00.399 --> 01:38:01.966
[coughing]


01:38:03.228 --> 01:38:04.403
Sonic, look.


01:38:14.630 --> 01:38:16.502
Shadow and Robotnik.


01:38:16.676 --> 01:38:18.896
They sacrificed
themselves...


01:38:19.070 --> 01:38:21.072
to save everyone.


01:38:21.811 --> 01:38:23.857
You always have a choice.


01:38:25.119 --> 01:38:27.861
Guys, I'’m really sorry
for running off like that.


01:38:28.035 --> 01:38:29.645
I shouldn'’t have
left you behind.


01:38:31.430 --> 01:38:33.040
The truth is...


01:38:33.214 --> 01:38:35.869
you'’re the best teammates
a hedgehog could ever ask for.


01:38:37.610 --> 01:38:39.438
And the best friends.


01:38:39.612 --> 01:38:41.483
Can you ever forgive me?


01:38:45.574 --> 01:38:47.359
Team Sonic?


01:38:51.450 --> 01:38:54.061
[Sonic]
How about just "team"?


01:39:02.374 --> 01:39:03.984
Goodbye, Doctor.


01:39:20.522 --> 01:39:22.829
[Sonic] Big finish.[Knuckles] Mmm!


01:39:24.352 --> 01:39:26.789
Now that'’s
what I call teamwork.


01:39:26.964 --> 01:39:28.748
Okay! It'’s ready!


01:39:28.922 --> 01:39:30.402
[munching]


01:39:30.576 --> 01:39:31.751
[gasps]


01:39:31.925 --> 01:39:33.579
Knuckles,
how could you?


01:39:33.753 --> 01:39:35.581
Gotta be faster than that!


01:39:36.495 --> 01:39:37.583
Give me a break.


01:39:37.757 --> 01:39:39.063
Still moving a little slow
over here.


01:39:39.237 --> 01:39:41.021
Donut Lord!Yay!


01:39:41.195 --> 01:39:42.718
[pained groan]


01:39:42.892 --> 01:39:45.547
Okay, Knuckles, that'’s...I am having the love.


01:39:45.721 --> 01:39:47.071
[barks]
I want the love!


01:39:47.245 --> 01:39:49.943
[Tails] Aww...Get in here, Ozzy.


01:39:50.117 --> 01:39:51.814
It'’s great
to be back together.


01:39:51.989 --> 01:39:53.816
We'’re stronger than ever.


01:39:53.991 --> 01:39:56.428
And nothing is gonna
stand in our way.


01:39:57.777 --> 01:40:01.607
Except that one piece
of unfinished business.


01:40:10.659 --> 01:40:13.662
And way out in front, to the
surprise of absolutely no one,


01:40:13.836 --> 01:40:15.012
it'’s the Blue Blur!


01:40:15.186 --> 01:40:16.926
Often imitated,
never duplicated,


01:40:17.101 --> 01:40:18.319
the one, the only...


01:40:18.493 --> 01:40:19.233
[yells]


01:40:19.407 --> 01:40:20.887
Let'’s do this!


01:40:21.061 --> 01:40:23.237
Yeah! [laughs]


01:40:23.411 --> 01:40:26.501
[yells]All right, boys,
try and keep up.


01:40:27.198 --> 01:40:29.069
[all cheering, whooping]


01:40:33.595 --> 01:40:36.598
["Run It"
by Jelly Roll playing]


01:42:22.922 --> 01:42:26.447
Sonic the Hedgehog
is Family Champion once again!


01:42:27.100 --> 01:42:28.145
Tails?


01:42:28.710 --> 01:42:30.234
Knuckles?


01:42:31.887 --> 01:42:34.847
Okay. Yeah, I overshot
the finish line.


01:42:38.764 --> 01:42:40.244
[electronic whirring]


01:42:43.769 --> 01:42:46.772
[Sonic] Okay,
so how do I get back?


01:42:49.296 --> 01:42:51.037
[weapon powering up]


01:42:51.820 --> 01:42:53.822
[beeping]


01:42:58.175 --> 01:42:59.263
[Sonic] Pro tip:


01:42:59.437 --> 01:43:00.655
If you'’re gonna take a shot


01:43:00.829 --> 01:43:02.962
at the fastest creature
in the universe...


01:43:05.312 --> 01:43:06.922
you'’d better not miss.


01:43:10.752 --> 01:43:13.364
Um... I'’m flattered
by the cosplay,


01:43:13.538 --> 01:43:15.235
but you got
a few details wrong.


01:43:15.409 --> 01:43:18.282
I can'’t blame you, though.
It'’s hard to copy perfection.


01:43:28.379 --> 01:43:30.381
That'’s a neat trick.


01:43:38.998 --> 01:43:40.217
[Sonic yelps]


01:43:42.306 --> 01:43:44.221
What? Who are you?

